    "title": "RG3: Villanova Women's Basketball Head Manager And SpO Athlete - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Megan Dussault ,\n1 days ago For the past seven years, the managers of the Villanova women’s basketball team have been led by head manager Rachel Grace, who is better known by her nickname, RG3. RG3, who has Down Syndrome, is a Special Olympics athlete in addition to her head manager duties, and has had a lifelong love of athletics. She grew up playing basketball, starting at the age of five, and later found soccer. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
